    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97336" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρωμᾰτό-δεσμον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a
				leathern</i> or <i>linen sack in which slaves had to tie up
				the bedclothes</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρώματα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				253
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				185
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.4.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.99
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. συσκευάσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					175e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					398a8
				</span></i>
			: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρωμᾰτό-δεσμος</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Amips.
				38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				49
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				379
			</span></i>.</div>
